@cifraclub_scraper_backend_csharp_HostAddress = http://localhost:8015

### Health Check
GET {{cifraclub_scraper_backend_csharp_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### Scrape Artist Songs (POST)
POST {{cifraclub_scraper_backend_csharp_HostAddress}}/scrape
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.cifraclub.com.br/los-cafres/",
  "limit": 5
}

###

### Scrape Artist Songs (GET)
GET {{cifraclub_scraper_backend_csharp_HostAddress}}/scrape?url=https://www.cifraclub.com.br/los-cafres/&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Generate PDF from URL
POST {{cifraclub_scraper_backend_csharp_HostAddress}}/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.cifraclub.com.br/los-cafres/",
  "limit": 3
}

